1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:02,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

2
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:38,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>JUJUTSU KAISEN</b></font>

3
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:33,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[echoing footsteps]</b></font>

4
00:01:39,220 --> 00:01:42,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>JUJUTSU KAISEN</b></font>

5
00:01:42,390 --> 00:01:44,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] Well, look who it is.</b></font>

6
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:46,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And what an ugly face
you've got there.</b></font>

7
00:01:46,690 --> 00:01:48,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm pretty sure
it's beyond fixing.</b></font>

8
00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:50,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are you planning
to do, Maki?</b></font>

9
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:52,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

10
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:54,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] You mean you can actually
tell women apart by their faces?</b></font>

11
00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:56,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought
you only saw their asses.</b></font>

12
00:02:01,540 --> 00:02:04,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ discordant notes play]</b></font>

13
00:02:05,580 --> 00:02:07,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] I'm asking you
what you're going to do.</b></font>

14
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So answer me,
you piece of trash.</b></font>

15
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:13,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can't use sorcery.
You can't see cursed spirits.</b></font>

16
00:02:13,170 --> 00:02:15,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The looks you had
going for you are ruined.</b></font>

17
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:19,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one is ever going to
pay attention to you again.</b></font>

18
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:22,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Maki sobbing]
-Such a sad situation.</b></font>

19
00:02:22,810 --> 00:02:24,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shall I bully you
like I used to?</b></font>

20
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:27,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Maki sobbing]</b></font>

21
00:02:27,610 --> 00:02:29,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] What are you
going to do?</b></font>

22
00:02:29,270 --> 00:02:31,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Cling to the shadow
of Okkotsu or Megumi?</b></font>

23
00:02:34,990 --> 00:02:37,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Say something, trash.</b></font>

24
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:41,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI AND MAI’S MOTHER] Maki.
Come back. Have you forgotten?</b></font>

25
00:02:42,330 --> 00:02:44,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know very well that
we're not allowed entry</b></font>

26
00:02:44,710 --> 00:02:46,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>into the Forbidden Vault.</b></font>

27
00:02:47,380 --> 00:02:49,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't worry, the clan head
gave me permission.</b></font>

28
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[keys clinking]</b></font>

29
00:02:51,510 --> 00:02:53,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
Head of the Zen'in Clan?</b></font>

30
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MEGUMI] Me?
-[MAKI] Yeah.</b></font>

31
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:57,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was in Naobito's will.</b></font>

32
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:59,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] No, thanks.
It'll just be a hassle.</b></font>

33
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI]
I think you should accept.</b></font>

34
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:02,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Naobito said
he would entrust</b></font>

35
00:03:02,770 --> 00:03:04,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>all of the Zen'in Clan's
assets to you,</b></font>

36
00:03:04,730 --> 00:03:07,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>both the money
and the cursed tools.</b></font>

37
00:03:07,310 --> 00:03:08,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you become head of the clan,</b></font>

38
00:03:08,940 --> 00:03:11,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll be able to get info
on the big three families</b></font>

39
00:03:11,190 --> 00:03:12,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and their headquarters.</b></font>

40
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:15,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It'll make a huge difference in
what we can do from here on out.</b></font>

41
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:17,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Sounds like
you should do it, Maki.</b></font>

42
00:03:17,610 --> 00:03:18,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can have it.</b></font>

43
00:03:18,740 --> 00:03:20,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, well, no one's
going to accept me</b></font>

44
00:03:20,370 --> 00:03:21,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as the head of the clan.</b></font>

45
00:03:21,370 --> 00:03:22,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one's gonna follow me yet.</b></font>

46
00:03:22,870 --> 00:03:26,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The fact is, you possess
the hereditary technique,</b></font>

47
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:28,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and you can activate
your domain.</b></font>

48
00:03:28,290 --> 00:03:30,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And you received
lots of attention from Satoru,</b></font>

49
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>yet they would
barely accept you.</b></font>

50
00:03:33,510 --> 00:03:35,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why do I need their acceptance?</b></font>

51
00:03:35,420 --> 00:03:36,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Does it even matter
what the members</b></font>

52
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of the Zen'in Clan
think about it?</b></font>

53
00:03:39,140 --> 00:03:41,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You get all those benefits
if you became the head, too,</b></font>

54
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so just do it already.</b></font>

55
00:03:43,930 --> 00:03:45,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] It's too soon.</b></font>

56
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:46,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can't be me yet.</b></font>

57
00:03:49,060 --> 00:03:51,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wouldn't be able
to create a place for Mai.</b></font>

58
00:03:57,150 --> 00:03:58,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] All right, fine.</b></font>

59
00:03:58,530 --> 00:04:02,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI AND MAI’S MOTHER]
Come back here!</b></font>

60
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:09,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell me why?</b></font>

61
00:04:09,370 --> 00:04:12,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell me why must you
always be like this, Maki?</b></font>

62
00:04:12,750 --> 00:04:14,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps departing]</b></font>

63
00:04:17,220 --> 00:04:22,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just this once, make me happy
I gave birth to you, Maki.</b></font>

64
00:04:23,470 --> 00:04:24,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[metal clacks]</b></font>

65
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ripping]</b></font>

66
00:04:38,650 --> 00:04:39,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Father.</b></font>

67
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA]
You should've said something</b></font>

68
00:04:42,410 --> 00:04:43,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you were
planning this from the get-go.</b></font>

69
00:04:43,990 --> 00:04:46,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JINICHI]
You jumped the gun like always.</b></font>

70
00:04:46,540 --> 00:04:50,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though I agree Megumi Fushiguro
would be better than you.</b></font>

71
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] Excuse me?</b></font>

72
00:04:51,370 --> 00:04:53,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's more than
a few voices pushing for him</b></font>

73
00:04:53,590 --> 00:04:56,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as a chance to repair
relations with the Gojo Clan.</b></font>

74
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:59,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But you know there's no way
we could accept Fushiguro</b></font>

75
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:02,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>being entrusted with
all the money and cursed tools.</b></font>

76
00:05:02,090 --> 00:05:03,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] Then why
were you dilly-dallying?</b></font>

77
00:05:03,930 --> 00:05:06,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because Fushiguro,
in addition to the Gojo Clan,</b></font>

78
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>has other alliances.</b></font>

79
00:05:08,350 --> 00:05:11,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's friendly with Noritoshi,
the next head of the Kamo Clan.</b></font>

80
00:05:11,810 --> 00:05:13,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we eliminate him
without cause,</b></font>

81
00:05:13,650 --> 00:05:16,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it would put the Zen'in Clan
in a worse spot.</b></font>

82
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:18,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With Satoru Gojo sealed away,</b></font>

83
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the power balance between
clans shifting, we'll fall--</b></font>

84
00:05:20,610 --> 00:05:23,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I get all that, but what I don't
is why do it now?</b></font>

85
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:26,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You haven't read the notices
from headquarters yet, have you?</b></font>

86
00:05:26,660 --> 00:05:28,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We can make use of that.</b></font>

87
00:05:28,370 --> 00:05:31,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Label them as traitors
plotting to release Satoru Gojo.</b></font>

88
00:05:31,460 --> 00:05:34,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And then Megumi,
Maki, and Mai can be killed.</b></font>

89
00:05:34,670 --> 00:05:36,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

90
00:05:36,300 --> 00:05:37,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's an impressive plan.</b></font>

91
00:05:37,590 --> 00:05:40,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Killing his own daughters
adds believability.</b></font>

92
00:05:40,050 --> 00:05:43,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It will. Afterwards, the trust
that headquarters places in us</b></font>

93
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:45,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-will grow firmer.
-[NAOYA] Hmm.</b></font>

94
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:47,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And is old man Ogi
okay with all of this?</b></font>

95
00:05:47,930 --> 00:05:49,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JINICHI]
Ogi came up with this plan.</b></font>

96
00:05:49,930 --> 00:05:52,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OGI] There are no
cursed tools here, Maki.</b></font>

97
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:55,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We emptied our vault in
anticipation of your intentions.</b></font>

98
00:05:58,030 --> 00:06:01,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Mai grunting weakly]
Why did you come here?</b></font>

99
00:06:01,740 --> 00:06:03,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You idiot.</b></font>

100
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:14,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>JUZO KUMIYA'S MASTERPIECE,
THE CURSED TOOL "DRAGON BONE"</b></font>

101
00:06:17,790 --> 00:06:20,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>SECRET ART:
FALLING BLOSSOM EMOTION</b></font>

102
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:23,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OGI] Do you know why they
named my older brother Naobito</b></font>

103
00:06:23,970 --> 00:06:27,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the previous head
of the clan, instead of me?</b></font>

104
00:06:27,050 --> 00:06:28,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] I'm guessing
because you're an asshole</b></font>

105
00:06:28,810 --> 00:06:30,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who would murder
his own children.</b></font>

106
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[swords swish, clang]</b></font>

107
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[clangs]</b></font>

108
00:06:45,490 --> 00:06:48,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You never wondered why I was
passed over as head of the clan?</b></font>

109
00:06:48,740 --> 00:06:49,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] How?</b></font>

110
00:06:49,990 --> 00:06:52,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OGI] It was because
my two children...</b></font>

111
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:55,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MAKI] I know I...
-...were such hopeless failures!</b></font>

112
00:06:55,210 --> 00:06:56,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI]...broke his blade.</b></font>

113
00:07:01,210 --> 00:07:03,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[footsteps]
-[dragging]</b></font>

114
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:07,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OGI] You broke my blade</b></font>

115
00:07:07,970 --> 00:07:10,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and judged that my reach
had been shortened,</b></font>

116
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:12,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so you closed in on me.</b></font>

117
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is why you're hopeless.</b></font>

118
00:07:15,190 --> 00:07:17,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not a swordsman,
I'm a sorcerer.</b></font>

119
00:07:17,810 --> 00:07:20,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Trying to gauge me by
the standards of such a failure</b></font>

120
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:22,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is absolutely ridiculous.</b></font>

121
00:07:22,110 --> 00:07:24,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll say it
as many times as I must.</b></font>

122
00:07:24,530 --> 00:07:27,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wasn't chosen to be
the previous head of the clan</b></font>

123
00:07:27,530 --> 00:07:29,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>because of the two of you.</b></font>

124
00:07:29,490 --> 00:07:32,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My older brother's technique
was nothing to speak of.</b></font>

125
00:07:32,490 --> 00:07:34,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And his potential
to inherit the clan</b></font>

126
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:36,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was never a point of contention.</b></font>

127
00:07:36,460 --> 00:07:39,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As a jujutsu sorcerer,
I never lagged behind my brother</b></font>

128
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:42,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in any area except one.</b></font>

129
00:07:42,250 --> 00:07:44,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The quality of my two children.</b></font>

130
00:07:46,220 --> 00:07:48,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The one rule for children.</b></font>

131
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:50,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Never drag down your parents.</b></font>

132
00:07:51,350 --> 00:07:52,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAI] Didn't you know?</b></font>

133
00:07:52,970 --> 00:07:55,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Dragging each other down
is considered a virtue</b></font>

134
00:07:55,470 --> 00:07:56,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in this country.</b></font>

135
00:07:59,270 --> 00:08:00,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[body rolling down]</b></font>

136
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:06,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OGI] This room is used
for training and punishment.</b></font>

137
00:08:06,570 --> 00:08:08,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We keep countless grade-two</b></font>

138
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:10,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and lower cursed spirits
in here.</b></font>

139
00:08:10,990 --> 00:08:13,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're hiding now
because they're afraid of me.</b></font>

140
00:08:13,370 --> 00:08:14,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But soon enough,
they'll crawl out</b></font>

141
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:16,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and begin to devour you.</b></font>

142
00:08:17,410 --> 00:08:20,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A Heavenly Pact?
Enhanced physical prowess?</b></font>

143
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What of it?</b></font>

144
00:08:22,170 --> 00:08:24,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We sorcerers train every day,</b></font>

145
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:26,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and we further
strengthen our bodies</b></font>

146
00:08:26,210 --> 00:08:29,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with cursed energy and combat.</b></font>

147
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:32,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maki, your power's ordinary.</b></font>

148
00:08:32,350 --> 00:08:35,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What you possess, every
single one of us already has.</b></font>

149
00:08:35,970 --> 00:08:39,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good riddance
to the sole stain on my life.</b></font>

150
00:08:39,350 --> 00:08:41,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps departing]</b></font>

151
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:47,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Mai grunts]</b></font>

152
00:08:47,990 --> 00:08:51,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

153
00:09:16,010 --> 00:09:17,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAI] Maki.</b></font>

154
00:09:18,100 --> 00:09:19,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You certainly are tough.</b></font>

155
00:09:23,900 --> 00:09:25,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I always figured</b></font>

156
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:28,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it would come to this one day.</b></font>

157
00:09:43,330 --> 00:09:44,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This really sucks.</b></font>

158
