161
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:13,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAI]
You basically know at this point</b></font>

162
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:15,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what my technique can do, right?</b></font>

163
00:10:15,660 --> 00:10:17,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Although I still have trouble
creating anything</b></font>

164
00:10:17,950 --> 00:10:19,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>too large or complicated.</b></font>

165
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:25,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm wounded
from where he cut me, too.</b></font>

166
00:10:25,540 --> 00:10:28,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So after I create this,
I'll die.</b></font>

167
00:10:28,590 --> 00:10:29,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Later.</b></font>

168
00:10:31,590 --> 00:10:33,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good luck on
your own after this.</b></font>

169
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:35,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey. Mai, wait!</b></font>

170
00:10:37,010 --> 00:10:40,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are you talking about?
Just come back here!</b></font>

171
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:42,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAI] I've known
for a long time now</b></font>

172
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:45,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why twins are considered to be
such an unfortunate accident</b></font>

173
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by jujutsu sorcerers.</b></font>

174
00:10:48,730 --> 00:10:51,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You have to offer up something
in order to gain anything.</b></font>

175
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:54,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This goes beyond just pacts.</b></font>

176
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The fact that we go through
pain to grow stronger</b></font>

177
00:10:56,450 --> 00:10:58,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>follows the same logic.</b></font>

178
00:11:00,580 --> 00:11:03,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that balance
never functions properly</b></font>

179
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the case of twins like us.</b></font>

180
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:10,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because jujutsu
views identical twins</b></font>

181
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:12,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as the same individual.</b></font>

182
00:11:13,630 --> 00:11:15,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you understand?</b></font>

183
00:11:15,130 --> 00:11:17,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are me, and I am you.</b></font>

184
00:11:18,550 --> 00:11:20,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can long to grow stronger</b></font>

185
00:11:20,100 --> 00:11:22,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and work so hard
you spit up blood.</b></font>

186
00:11:23,060 --> 00:11:24,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's all pointless.</b></font>

187
00:11:24,980 --> 00:11:27,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because I don't want
to grow stronger at all.</b></font>

188
00:11:29,230 --> 00:11:31,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if you don't
have any techniques,</b></font>

189
00:11:31,610 --> 00:11:33,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's pointless if I have one.</b></font>

190
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:38,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So long as I exist, Maki,
you will always be incomplete.</b></font>

191
00:11:38,370 --> 00:11:39,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] Okay, I get it!</b></font>

192
00:11:40,530 --> 00:11:41,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just come back.</b></font>

193
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:44,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAI] This is all
I'll leave you with.</b></font>

194
00:11:44,750 --> 00:11:46,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Cast off the rest.</b></font>

195
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:47,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ ethereal music playing]</b></font>

196
00:11:50,420 --> 00:11:54,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll take all the cursed energy
and everything else with me too.</b></font>

197
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:58,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just promise me one thing.</b></font>

198
00:11:59,390 --> 00:12:02,810
