00:19:19,700 --> 00:19:22,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Maki exhales]</b></font>

315
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:24,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RANTA]
Forget about me, Jinichi!</b></font>

316
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:26,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The current
Zen'in Clan only exists</b></font>

317
00:19:26,250 --> 00:19:27,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>thanks to the whim of Toji!</b></font>

318
00:19:28,080 --> 00:19:30,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You must have
realized it by now!</b></font>

319
00:19:30,040 --> 00:19:32,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maki's become
the same as that man!</b></font>

320
00:19:32,710 --> 00:19:35,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do it! Here and now!</b></font>

321
00:19:35,130 --> 00:19:38,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kill her!</b></font>

322
00:19:51,940 --> 00:19:54,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[explosion]</b></font>

323
00:20:06,330 --> 00:20:07,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You did it, Jinichi.</b></font>

324
00:20:08,370 --> 00:20:10,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You were able to kill her.</b></font>

325
00:20:17,090 --> 00:20:18,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[blood splattering]</b></font>

326
00:20:18,430 --> 00:20:20,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps approaching]</b></font>

327
00:20:26,180 --> 00:20:27,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] How cruel of you.</b></font>

328
00:20:27,980 --> 00:20:29,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>HEAD OF THE HEI, NAOYA ZEN'IN</b></font>

329
00:20:29,270 --> 00:20:31,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have you no heart
left inside of you, Maki?</b></font>

330
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:34,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't.</b></font>

331
00:20:34,530 --> 00:20:36,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She took
whatever heart I had with her.</b></font>

332
00:20:37,570 --> 00:20:39,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA]
Everyone says I'm a genius.</b></font>

333
00:20:39,360 --> 00:20:40,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's true, too!</b></font>

334
00:20:40,990 --> 00:20:43,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm going to be the head
of the clan after my father.</b></font>

335
00:20:46,290 --> 00:20:48,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I heard there's a loser
in the Zen'in Clan.</b></font>

336
00:20:48,790 --> 00:20:50,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They say the man ain't
got a bit of cursed energy</b></font>

337
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in his whole body.</b></font>

338
00:20:54,170 --> 00:20:56,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He must be really depressed.</b></font>

339
00:20:58,970 --> 00:21:01,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I bet you that guy
looks pretty pathetic, too.</b></font>

340
00:21:05,850 --> 00:21:08,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] Three, four,
five, nine, ten, eleven.</b></font>

341
00:21:09,100 --> 00:21:10,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] You...</b></font>

342
00:21:14,150 --> 00:21:15,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You...</b></font>

343
00:21:19,360 --> 00:21:20,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ain't no Toji!</b></font>

344
00:21:22,620 --> 00:21:26,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The sin of the insignificant
is the ignorance of strength.</b></font>

345
00:21:26,450 --> 00:21:28,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one was able
to understand Toji.</b></font>

346
00:21:30,870 --> 00:21:33,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Except maybe Satoru Gojo.</b></font>

347
00:21:33,500 --> 00:21:35,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But you ain't the one!</b></font>

348
00:21:35,210 --> 00:21:37,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The one to stand
among them is me!</b></font>

349
00:21:44,510 --> 00:21:46,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Projection Sorcery</b></font>

350
00:21:46,060 --> 00:21:47,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>can't be used
to create movements</b></font>

351
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that ignore physics
and trajectories.</b></font>

352
00:21:49,730 --> 00:21:52,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a limit to how much
acceleration can be added</b></font>

353
00:21:52,390 --> 00:21:54,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to one's speed upon activation.</b></font>

354
00:21:54,310 --> 00:21:56,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The longer the technique
is continuously activated,</b></font>

355
00:21:56,900 --> 00:21:59,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the further one can
raise their speed.</b></font>

356
00:21:59,360 --> 00:22:01,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA]
The one to stand among them</b></font>

357
00:22:01,450 --> 00:22:02,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is me!</b></font>

358
00:22:11,540 --> 00:22:13,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't stop now.</b></font>

359
00:22:13,040 --> 00:22:15,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't screw up
like I did back then!</b></font>

360
00:22:15,840 --> 00:22:18,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Force is weight times speed.</b></font>

361
00:22:37,020 --> 00:22:39,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She wants a head-on fight, huh?</b></font>

362
00:22:39,690 --> 00:22:40,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] How about a hug?</b></font>

363
00:22:40,940 --> 00:22:43,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] I'll punch
through her at top speed!</b></font>

364
00:22:47,700 --> 00:22:49,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] While
Projection Sorcery is active,</b></font>

365
00:22:49,490 --> 00:22:51,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>anything the user touches
with their palm</b></font>

366
00:22:51,290 --> 00:22:54,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>must create a movement
within 1/24th of a second.</b></font>

367
00:22:54,170 --> 00:22:56,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If they fail, they'll be
frozen for one second.</b></font>

368
00:23:01,710 --> 00:23:03,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] She was probably
planning to take my attack</b></font>

369
00:23:03,840 --> 00:23:05,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and stop my movement,</b></font>

370
00:23:05,340 --> 00:23:07,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even if it means
I break her ribs.</b></font>

371
00:23:07,680 --> 00:23:10,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like I'd fall
for such obvious bait!</b></font>

372
00:23:10,310 --> 00:23:12,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You really are an imposter!</b></font>

373
00:23:16,940 --> 00:23:18,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>24 times, right?</b></font>

374
00:23:19,110 --> 00:23:21,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You and old man Naobito
aren't just fast,</b></font>

375
00:23:21,570 --> 00:23:23,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's something off
about your speed.</b></font>

376
00:23:24,360 --> 00:23:27,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You were creating
24 motions per second.</b></font>

377
00:23:27,280 --> 00:23:29,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can finally see it
after obtaining this body.</b></font>

378
00:23:30,870 --> 00:23:34,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You imposter! [groans]</b></font>

379
00:23:34,450 --> 00:23:35,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

380
00:23:35,960 --> 00:23:37,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

381
00:23:37,500 --> 00:23:38,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

382
00:24:00,690 --> 00:24:01,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry.</b></font>

383
00:24:02,690 --> 00:24:04,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can you repeat that?</b></font>

384
00:24:05,360 --> 00:24:06,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mother?</b></font>

385
00:24:11,080 --> 00:24:12,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mother?</b></font>

386
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:22,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Mother?
-[gasps]</b></font>

387
00:24:22,590 --> 00:24:24,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Stay away!
-Mother.</b></font>

388
00:24:24,380 --> 00:24:26,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Why must you?
-Please, listen to me.</b></font>

389
00:24:26,220 --> 00:24:28,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why must you
always be like this?</b></font>

390
00:24:28,220 --> 00:24:29,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If that's the way you feel,</b></font>

391
00:24:30,300 --> 00:24:31,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why tell me to come back?</b></font>

392
00:24:31,640 --> 00:24:33,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh? W... What?</b></font>

393
00:24:33,930 --> 00:24:35,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are you talking about?</b></font>

394
00:24:37,270 --> 00:24:41,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No. No, no, no! [whimpering]</b></font>

395
00:24:41,230 --> 00:24:42,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[sword slashes]
-[groans]</b></font>

396
00:24:42,440 --> 00:24:43,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

397
00:24:43,820 --> 00:24:46,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Naoya breathing raggedly]</b></font>

398
00:24:46,940 --> 00:24:49,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasping, laughing]</b></font>

399
00:24:50,360 --> 00:24:52,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stupid bitch didn't end me.</b></font>

400
00:24:53,120 --> 00:24:54,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Pathetic.</b></font>

401
00:24:54,370 --> 00:24:56,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathing raggedly]</b></font>

402
00:25:04,130 --> 00:25:07,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps] Are you shitting me?</b></font>

403
00:25:07,510 --> 00:25:10,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't focus my cursed energy!</b></font>

404
00:25:10,720 --> 00:25:13,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Damn gutter trash!</b></font>

405
00:25:13,550 --> 00:25:14,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

406
00:25:16,180 --> 00:25:17,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exhales]</b></font>

407
00:25:17,980 --> 00:25:19,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Mai and Maki giggling]</b></font>

408
00:25:19,480 --> 00:25:22,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAI AND MAKI'S MOTHER]
I'm glad I gave birth to you.</b></font>

409
00:25:22,810 --> 00:25:25,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Momo running, panting]</b></font>

410
00:25:27,190 --> 00:25:29,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MOMO] Mai! [sobbing]</b></font>

411
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:40,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is why
I told you not to go. [crying]</b></font>

412
00:25:40,370 --> 00:25:42,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sobbing]</b></font>

413
00:25:42,750 --> 00:25:45,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] Please,
take care of her.</b></font>

414
00:25:45,790 --> 00:25:49,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MOMO] What are you
gonna do now, Maki?</b></font>

415
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:54,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The six members of the Hei,
the nine members of the Akashi,</b></font>

416
00:25:54,050 --> 00:25:55,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the 21 members
of the Kukuru Unit</b></font>

417
00:25:55,600 --> 00:25:57,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who were absent from
the Zen'in Clan's home that day</b></font>

418
00:25:57,600 --> 00:25:58,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>all met untimely deaths.</b></font>

419
00:25:58,850 --> 00:26:00,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At present,
no residuals have been detected,</b></font>

420
00:26:00,390 --> 00:26:02,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and autopsies revealed
faint traces of cursed energy</b></font>

421
00:26:02,190 --> 00:26:03,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the corpses' wounds
that are believed to come</b></font>

422
00:26:03,520 --> 00:26:04,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the cursed tool
used as the murder weapon.</b></font>

423
00:26:05,020 --> 00:26:06,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Several days later, both
the Gojo Clan and Kamo Clan</b></font>

424
00:26:06,690 --> 00:26:08,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>motioned for headquarters
to remove the Zen'in Clan</b></font>

425
00:26:08,570 --> 00:26:09,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the big three families.</b></font>

426
00:26:09,690 --> 00:26:10,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Headquarters has tabled
this motion.</b></font>

427
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:22,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

428
00:27:50,420 --> 00:27:51,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
Hakari was expelled for clashing</b></font>

429
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:53,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-with the Upper Brass.
-[YUJI] A fight club?</b></font>

430
00:27:53,800 --> 00:27:55,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MACHO] You don't
talk about the fight club.</b></font>

431
00:27:55,470 --> 00:27:56,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] I can't get close.</b></font>

432
00:27:57,010 --> 00:27:58,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Itadori, you
snoop around from the inside.</b></font>

433
00:27:58,890 --> 00:28:00,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA] I love it
when you're hot, Kin.</b></font>

434
00:28:00,510 --> 00:28:03,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] Are you saying you
wanna get high on my passion?</b></font>

435
00:28:03,270 --> 00:28:04,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>NEXT EPISODE
PASSION</b></font>

